"<code>&#123;&#123; attrs &#125;&#125;</code> pass-through — anything you "
"type lands on the rendered HTML. Try <code>disabled</code>, "
"<code>id=\"…\"</code>, <code>data-*</code>, <code>aria-*</code>, "
"<code>style=\"…\"</code>… <em>Heads up</em>: <code>class</code> may "
"duplicate if the component already declares one (HTML keeps the first)."
