"<strong>Zombie</strong> — nothing in the catalog or your templates "
"references this component. If that's intentional (a library or WIP "
"component), add <code>&#123;# @ignore-unused #&#125;</code> to silence "
"this."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Zombie</strong> — rien dans le catalogue ni dans vos gabarits ne "
"référence ce composant. Si c'est intentionnel (un composant de bibliothèque"
" ou en cours), ajoutez <code>&#123;# @ignore-unused #&#125;</code> pour le "
"masquer."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:495
msgid "Uses"
msgstr "Utilise"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:498
msgid ""
"<strong>What this component needs.</strong> Each item is another catalog "
"component referenced via <code>&lt;c-X.Y&gt;</code> inside this template — "
"delete one and this template stops rendering."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Ce dont ce composant a besoin.</strong> Chaque entrée est un autre "
"composant du catalogue référencé via <code>&lt;c-X.Y&gt;</code> dans ce "
"template — supprimez-en un et ce template cesse de fonctionner."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:506
msgid ""
"Standalone — this template doesn't reference any other catalog component."
msgstr ""
"Autonome — ce template ne référence aucun autre composant du catalogue."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:511
msgid "Used by"
msgstr "Utilisé par"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:514
msgid ""
"<strong>Where this is rendered from</strong> (inside the catalog). Editing "
"this component impacts every entry below — re-check each one before "
"merging."
msgstr ""
"<strong>D'où ceci est rendu</strong> (dans le catalogue). Modifier ce "
"composant impacte chaque entrée ci-dessous."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:522
msgid "Nothing in the catalog renders this component."
msgstr "Rien dans le catalogue ne rend ce composant."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:527
msgid "External usage"
msgstr "Utilisation externe"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:530
msgid ""
"<strong>Consumer-side renderers.</strong> Templates in your project's "
"<code>templates/</code> (outside the catalog) that include this component. "
"Catches usage the gallery alone can't see and helps spot zombies."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Rendus côté consommateur.</strong> Templates dans le "
"<code>templates/</code> de votre projet (hors du catalogue) qui incluent ce"
" composant."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:539
msgid "No template outside the catalog references this component."
msgstr "Aucun template hors du catalogue ne référence ce composant."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:544
msgid ""
"External-templates scanning is disabled by default — the gallery never "
"reads consumer code without explicit consent."
msgstr ""
"L'analyse des templates externes est désactivée par défaut — la galerie ne "
"lit jamais le code du consommateur sans consentement explicite."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:545
msgid ""
"Set <code>DJANGO_COTTON_GALLERY_SCAN_EXTERNAL_USERS = True</code> in your "
"Django settings to enable. Read-only, dev-only, only template paths are "
"exposed."
msgstr ""
"Définissez <code>DJANGO_COTTON_GALLERY_SCAN_EXTERNAL_USERS = True</code> "
"dans vos settings Django pour l'activer. Lecture seule, développement "
"uniquement, seuls les chemins des templates sont exposés."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:557
msgid "Full impact tree"
msgstr "Arbre d'impact complet"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:558
msgid ""
"The cards above show direct neighbours — this expands the chain "
"recursively. Click any branch to drill in."
msgstr ""
"Les cartes ci-dessus montrent les voisins directs — ceci développe la "
"chaîne de manière récursive. Cliquez sur une branche pour explorer."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:563
