#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/index.html:98
msgid ""
"Add <code>@prop</code> annotation headers at the top of each file so the "
"gallery can build interactive controls automatically."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute des en-têtes d'annotation <code>@prop</code> en haut de chaque "
"fichier pour que la galerie puisse construire les contrôles interactifs "
"automatiquement."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/index.html:99
msgid "Read the documentation →"
msgstr "Lire la documentation →"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/index.html:112
msgid "Optional: enable language switching"
msgstr "Optionnel : activer le changement de langue"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/index.html:113
msgid ""
"The gallery is translated into English, Spanish, Basque, and French — but "
"the language dropdown only appears when your project mounts Django's i18n "
"URLs and <code>LocaleMiddleware</code>. Add both in your "
"<code>urls.py</code> and <code>settings.py</code> to enable it."
msgstr ""
"La galerie est traduite en anglais, espagnol, basque et français — mais le "
"menu déroulant de langue n'apparaît que lorsque votre projet monte les URLs"
" i18n de Django et <code>LocaleMiddleware</code>. Ajoutez les deux dans "
"votre <code>urls.py</code> et <code>settings.py</code> pour l'activer."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/index.html:115
msgid "See the i18n setup steps →"
msgstr "Voir les étapes de configuration i18n →"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:8
msgid "Catalog insights"
msgstr "Aperçu du catalogue"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:10
msgid ""
"Health and usage signals across your component catalog. Lint, annotation "
"coverage and deprecation come from the catalog itself; zombies and most-"
"referenced metrics require scanning your project's templates and are opt-"
"in."
msgstr ""
"Signaux de santé et d'utilisation à travers votre catalogue de composants. "
"Lint, couverture des annotations et obsolescence viennent du catalogue lui-"
"même ; zombies et métriques les plus référencées nécessitent de scanner les"
" templates de votre projet et sont opt-in."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:16
msgid "Catalog"
msgstr "Catalogue"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:18
msgid "component"
msgid_plural "components"
msgstr[0] "composant"
msgstr[1] "composants"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:30
msgid "Lint health"
msgstr "Santé du lint"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:31
msgid "How is this score computed?"
msgstr "Comment ce score est-il calculé ?"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:37
msgid ""
"<strong>Higher is better.</strong> Starts at <strong>100</strong> (clean "
"catalog, no annotation issues) and subtracts <strong>5 per error</strong> "
"and <strong>1 per warning</strong>, floored at <strong>0</strong>. "
"<strong>Hints don't subtract</strong> — they're heuristic checks (e.g. "
"context-processor variables) that may produce false positives. So 100 = "
"perfect, 0 = lots of issues. Click \"Open lint report\" to see exactly "
"which rules fired."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Plus haut, c'est mieux.</strong> Commence à <strong>100</strong> "
"(catalogue propre, aucun problème d'annotation) et soustrait <strong>5 par "
"erreur</strong> et <strong>1 par avertissement</strong>, avec un plancher à"
" <strong>0</strong>. <strong>Les indices ne soustraient pas</strong> — ce "
"sont des contrôles heuristiques (ex. variables de processeurs de contexte) "
"qui peuvent produire des faux positifs."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:44
msgid "clean ✓"
msgstr "propre ✓"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:45
msgid "healthy"
msgstr "sain"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:46
msgid "needs attention"
msgstr "à surveiller"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:47
msgid "many issues"
msgstr "beaucoup de problèmes"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:59
msgid ""
"100 = clean · −5 / error · −1 / warning · hints don't subtract · higher is "
"better"
msgstr ""
"100 = propre · −5 / erreur · −1 / avertissement · les indices ne "
"soustraient pas · plus haut, mieux"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:60
msgid "Open lint report →"
msgstr "Ouvrir le rapport de lint →"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:65
msgid "Annotation coverage"
msgstr "Couverture d'annotations"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:66
msgid "What does each row mean?"
msgstr "Que signifie chaque ligne ?"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:72
msgid ""
"<strong>How many of your components carry which kind of "
"annotation.</strong> Higher = the gallery has more metadata to render rich "
"previews and the linter has more material to check. "
"<strong>Documented</strong>: have at least one <code>@description</code> or"
" <code>@prop</code>. <strong>With props</strong>: declare at least one "
"<code>@prop</code>. <strong>With slots</strong>: declare at least one "
"<code>@slot</code>. <strong>Accept attrs</strong>: render "
"<code>&#123;&#123; attrs &#125;&#125;</code> so callers can pass extra HTML"
" attributes through."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Combien de tes composants portent chaque type "
"d'annotation.</strong> Plus haut = la galerie a plus de métadonnées pour "
"rendre des previews riches et le linter a plus de matière à vérifier. "
"<strong>Documenté</strong> : ont au moins un <code>@description</code> ou "
"<code>@prop</code>. <strong>Avec props</strong> : déclarent au moins un "
"<code>@prop</code>. <strong>Avec slots</strong> : déclarent au moins un "
"<code>@slot</code>. <strong>Accepte attrs</strong> : rendent "
"<code>&#123;&#123; attrs &#125;&#125;</code> pour que les appelants "
"puissent passer des attributs HTML supplémentaires."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:76
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%% of components that carry each kind of annotation. Higher is better — "
"more metadata to drive the gallery's controls and lint checks."
msgstr ""
"%% de composants qui portent chaque type d'annotation. Plus haut est mieux "
"— plus de metadata pour les contrôles de la galerie et les vérifications du"
" lint."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:79
msgid "Components that have at least one @description or @prop comment"
msgstr "Composants qui ont au moins un commentaire @description ou @prop"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:79
msgid "Documented"
msgstr "Documenté"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:84
msgid "Components that declare at least one @prop"
msgstr "Composants qui déclarent au moins un @prop"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:84
msgid "With props"
msgstr "Avec props"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:89
msgid "Components that declare at least one @slot"
msgstr "Composants qui déclarent au moins un @slot"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:89
msgid "With slots"
msgstr "Avec slots"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:94
msgid ""
"Components that render {{ attrs }} so callers can pass extra HTML "
"attributes"
msgstr ""
"Composants qui rendent {{ attrs }} pour que les appelants puissent passer "
"des attributs HTML supplémentaires"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:94
msgid "Accept attrs"
msgstr "Accepte attrs"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:103
msgid "Cotton configuration"
msgstr "Configuration de Cotton"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:104
msgid "Why does this matter?"
msgstr "Pourquoi est-ce important ?"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:110
msgid ""
"A snapshot of the two Cotton settings the gallery cares about — "
"<strong>where</strong> it scans for components and <strong>how</strong> "
"Cotton maps your tags to files. Mismatches between your filenames and these"
" settings break previews silently, so this card flags them up front."
msgstr ""
"Un aperçu des deux paramètres Cotton qui comptent pour la galerie — "
"<strong>où</strong> elle scanne les composants et <strong>comment</strong> "
"Cotton mappe tes balises vers les fichiers. Les divergences entre tes "
"fichiers et ces paramètres cassent silencieusement les previews, donc cette"
" carte les signale en amont."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:126
msgid "What is COTTON_DIR?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que COTTON_DIR ?"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:131
msgid ""
"Subfolder name (relative to <code>TEMPLATES['DIRS']</code>) where Cotton — "
"and the gallery — look for component files. Default "
"<code>\"cotton\"</code>. Belongs to the Cotton folder convention; the "
"gallery just reads it."
msgstr ""
"Nom du sous-dossier (relatif à <code>TEMPLATES['DIRS']</code>) où Cotton — "
"et la galerie — cherchent les fichiers de composants. Par défaut "
"<code>\"cotton\"</code>. Appartient à la convention de dossier de Cotton ; "
"la galerie ne fait que le lire."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:140
msgid "Scanning"
msgstr "Analyse"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:141
msgid "What is being scanned?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qui est analysé ?"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:146
msgid ""
"The absolute filesystem path the gallery is currently scanning. If this "
"isn't where you expect your components to live, check your "
"TEMPLATES['DIRS'] and COTTON_DIR settings."
msgstr ""
"Le chemin absolu du système de fichiers que la galerie analyse "
"actuellement. Si ce n'est pas là où tu attends tes composants, vérifie tes "
"paramètres TEMPLATES['DIRS'] et COTTON_DIR."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:162
msgid "What does this setting do?"
msgstr "Que fait ce paramètre ?"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:167
msgid ""
"Cotton's setting that decides how a tag like <code>&lt;c-foo-bar "
"/&gt;</code> maps to a file. With <code>True</code> (Cotton's default) it "
"strips hyphens and looks for <code>foo_bar.html</code>; with "
"<code>False</code> it keeps the hyphen and looks for <code>foo-"
"bar.html</code>. The gallery indexes both styles transparently — pick "
"whichever you prefer and stay consistent across the catalog."
msgstr ""
"Setting de Cotton qui décide comment une balise comme <code>&lt;c-foo-bar "
"/&gt;</code> mappe à un fichier. Avec <code>True</code> (le défaut de "
"Cotton) il supprime les tirets et cherche <code>foo_bar.html</code> ; avec "
"<code>False</code> il garde le tiret et cherche <code>foo-bar.html</code>. "
"La galerie indexe les deux styles de manière transparente — choisissez "
"celui que vous préférez et restez cohérent dans tout le catalogue."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:187
msgid "error component"
msgid_plural "error components"
msgstr[0] "composant en erreur"
msgstr[1] "composants en erreur"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:188
msgid "How to fix this"
msgstr "Comment corriger ça"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:193
msgid ""
"Cotton transforms <code>-</code> into <code>_</code> when looking up files,"
" but these components have a hyphen in their filename — Cotton can't find "
"them. <strong>Two ways to fix it:</strong> rename the files (<code>form-"
"field.html</code> → <code>form_field.html</code>) <strong>or</strong> set "
"<code>COTTON_SNAKE_CASED_NAMES = False</code> in your "
"<code>settings.py</code> to keep the hyphens."
msgstr ""
"Cotton transforme <code>-</code> en <code>_</code> lors de la recherche de "
"fichiers, mais ces composants ont un tiret dans leur nom — Cotton ne les "
"trouve pas. <strong>Deux façons de corriger :</strong> renommer les "
"fichiers (<code>form-field.html</code> → <code>form_field.html</code>) "
"<strong>ou</strong> définir <code>COTTON_SNAKE_CASED_NAMES = False</code> "
"dans votre <code>settings.py</code> pour garder les tirets."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:198
msgid "Affected components:"
msgstr "Composants affectés :"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:208
msgid "suboptimal"
msgstr "sous-optimal"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:209
msgid "Why suboptimal?"
msgstr "Pourquoi sous-optimal ?"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:214
msgid ""
"Your filenames have no hyphens and <code>COTTON_SNAKE_CASED_NAMES = "
"True</code> — cotton's default. Cotton resolves your tags fine. If you'd "
"rather have kebab-case filenames matching your tags 1:1 (e.g. <code>form-"
"field.html</code> → <code>&lt;c-form-field /&gt;</code>), set the setting "
"to <code>False</code>; both styles work."
msgstr ""
"Vos noms de fichiers n'ont pas de tirets et <code>COTTON_SNAKE_CASED_NAMES "
"= True</code> — le défaut de cotton. Cotton résout vos balises sans "
"problème. Si vous préférez des noms en kebab-case qui correspondent 1:1 à "
"vos balises (p. ex. <code>form-field.html</code> → <code>&lt;c-form-field "
"/&gt;</code>), passez le setting à <code>False</code> ; les deux styles "
"fonctionnent."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:219
#, python-format
msgid ""
"All <strong>%(counter)s</strong> component is correctly named for this "
"configuration — Cotton's snake_case convention is being followed."
msgid_plural ""
"All <strong>%(counter)s</strong> components are correctly named for this "
"configuration — Cotton's snake_case convention is being followed."
msgstr[0] ""
"Le composant (<strong>%(counter)s</strong>) est correctement nommé pour "
"cette configuration — la convention snake_case de Cotton est respectée."
msgstr[1] ""
"Les <strong>%(counter)s</strong> composants sont correctement nommés pour "
"cette configuration — la convention snake_case de Cotton est respectée."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:224
msgid "optimal"
msgstr "optimal"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:225
msgid "Why optimal?"
msgstr "Pourquoi optimal ?"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:230
msgid ""
"Your filenames map 1:1 to Cotton tags (e.g. <code>atoms/form-"
"field.html</code> → <code>&lt;c-atoms.form-field /&gt;</code>). No "
"surprises."
msgstr ""
"Tes noms de fichiers se mappent 1:1 aux balises Cotton (ex. "
"<code>atoms/form-field.html</code> → <code>&lt;c-atoms.form-field "
"/&gt;</code>). Aucune surprise."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:235
#, python-format
msgid ""
"All <strong>%(counter)s</strong> component maps 1:1 to its Cotton tag. No "
"surprises."
msgid_plural ""
"All <strong>%(counter)s</strong> components map 1:1 to their Cotton tags. "
"No surprises."
msgstr[0] ""
"Le composant (<strong>%(counter)s</strong>) se mappe 1:1 à sa balise "
"Cotton. Aucune surprise."
msgstr[1] ""
"Les <strong>%(counter)s</strong> composants se mappent 1:1 à leurs balises "
"Cotton. Aucune surprise."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:251
msgid "No component declares deprecated props."
msgstr "Aucun composant ne déclare de prop obsolète."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:257
msgid "Coverage gaps"
msgstr "Lacunes de couverture"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:260
msgid ""
"Components missing a top-level @description, or with at least one prop that"
" has no description."
msgstr ""
"Composants sans @description au niveau supérieur ou avec au moins une prop "
"sans description."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:268
msgid "Every component and every prop is documented."
msgstr "Tous les composants et toutes les props sont documentés."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:274
msgid "External usage — where your components are referenced"
msgstr "Utilisation externe — où tes composants sont référencés"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:275
msgid "How does the scan work?"
msgstr "Comment l'analyse fonctionne-t-elle ?"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:281
msgid ""
"When opted in, the gallery walks every <code>.html</code> file under your "
"<code>TEMPLATES['DIRS']</code> entries and each app's "
"<code>templates/</code> folder, looking for <code>&lt;c-X.Y /&gt;</code> "
"tags that reference catalog components. The catalog itself (your "
"<code>cotton/</code>) is excluded — the scan only looks at consumer code. "
"Read-only, dev-only, only template paths surface in the UI."
msgstr ""
"Si tu actives, la galerie parcourt chaque fichier <code>.html</code> dans "
"tes entrées <code>TEMPLATES['DIRS']</code> et le dossier "
"<code>templates/</code> de chaque app, cherchant les balises "
"<code>&lt;c-X.Y /&gt;</code> qui référencent des composants du catalogue. "
"Le catalogue lui-même (ton <code>cotton/</code>) est exclu — l'analyse ne "
"regarde que le code consommateur. Lecture seule, dev uniquement, seuls les "
"chemins de templates apparaissent dans l'UI."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:284
msgid "scanning"
msgstr "analyse"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:284
msgid "disabled"
msgstr "désactivé"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:286
msgid ""
"Tracks who uses your components from OUTSIDE the catalog (your real pages, "
"layouts, partials). Without this, the gallery only knows about references "
"between catalog components themselves."
msgstr ""
"Suit qui utilise tes composants depuis l'EXTÉRIEUR du catalogue (tes vraies"
" pages, layouts, partials). Sans ça, la galerie ne connaît que les "
"références entre les composants du catalogue eux-mêmes."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:291
msgid "Most referenced"
msgstr "Les plus référencés"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:304
msgid "Nothing references your components yet."
msgstr "Rien ne référence encore vos composants."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:309
msgid "Zombies"
msgstr "Zombies"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:312
msgid ""
"Components with zero references — neither inside the catalog nor in your "
"project's templates."
msgstr ""
"Composants sans aucune référence — ni dans le catalogue ni dans les "
"templates de votre projet."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:320
msgid "Every component is used somewhere — clean catalog."
msgstr "Tous les composants sont utilisés quelque part — catalogue propre."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:327
msgid ""
"Zombies and most-referenced metrics require scanning your project's "
"templates."
msgstr ""
"Les métriques zombies et les plus référencés nécessitent de scanner les "
"templates de votre projet."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/insights.html:328
msgid ""
"The gallery never reads consumer code without consent. Set "
"<code>DJANGO_COTTON_GALLERY_SCAN_EXTERNAL_USERS = True</code> in your "
"Django settings to enable. Read-only, dev-only — only template paths are "
"exposed in the gallery UI."
msgstr ""
"La galerie ne lit jamais le code consommateur sans consentement. Définissez"
" <code>DJANGO_COTTON_GALLERY_SCAN_EXTERNAL_USERS = True</code> dans vos "
"settings Django pour l'activer. Lecture seule, développement uniquement — "
"seuls les chemins des templates sont exposés dans l'UI de la galerie."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/lint.html:8
msgid "Annotation lint"
msgstr "Lint d'annotations"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/lint.html:10
msgid ""
"Cross-checks each component's <code>@prop</code> comments against its "
"<code>&lt;c-vars&gt;</code> declaration. Errors mean the prop won't reach "
"the template; warnings flag undocumented or under-documented props."
msgstr ""
"Vérifie les commentaires <code>@prop</code> de chaque composant par rapport"
" à sa déclaration <code>&lt;c-vars&gt;</code>."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/lint.html:15
msgid "clean"
msgstr "propre"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/lint.html:39
msgid "Every component is properly annotated."
msgstr "Tous les composants sont correctement annotés."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/lint.html:66
msgid "Search component or rule…"
msgstr "Rechercher composant ou règle…"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/lint.html:82
msgid "No components match this filter."
msgstr "Aucun composant ne correspond à ce filtre."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/lint.html:99
msgid "err"
msgid_plural "err"
msgstr[0] "err"
msgstr[1] "err"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/lint.html:143
msgid "Show"
msgstr "Afficher"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/lint.html:149
msgid "Items per page"
msgstr "Éléments par page"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/lint.html:172
msgid "per page"
msgstr "par page"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/lint.html:177
